    "scenario": "You already activated your account but forgot your password. You want help using the 'Forgot Password' flow, using the temporary password email, and then creating a new password.",
    "header_description": "<p>You will listen to recordings of calls between a customer and a support agent. Each call is linked to a short scenario describing the customer's problem.</p>\n<p>You will hear <strong>two recordings about the same problem</strong>. Your task is to compare them and answer questions about which audio is better according to different criteria. For example: <em>\u201cThe customer explained their problems clearly and correctly\u201d \u2014 does this statement align more with Recording 1, Recording 2, or equally with both?</em></p>\n<p>You will also see a transcript, but please listen carefully: some questions focus on tone of voice and other subtle differences that can only be understood from the audio.</p>\n<p>If your answers are at least 90% accurate, you will receive a bonus payment.</p>"
